{"type":"message","id":"88451442","parentId":"fb92108f","timestamp":"2026-05-16T11:55:24.636Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 11:55 AM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 11:55 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778932524552}}
{"type":"message","id":"48deadce","parentId":"88451442","timestamp":"2026-05-16T11:55:31.476Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform for messages in two threads (arbitration and general), and respond to any new discussions that aren't from me. Let me start by fetching both threads simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-8577d8d0-cfbb-465a-b89d-a8548ea99e4f","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-11932b82-656d-42d4-97a2-e6b9abbab676","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":132,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11255,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778932524636,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e57a7959-c017-4d39-997e-698cdfa82c7e"}}
